    "el0-structure-group-2": {
      "scope": "Actual NeverD explicit-IR baseline AdvSIMD structure memory, 366-case group of unchanged 48/30-case batches covering 1134 independent LLVM MC words covering all LD1..LD4/ST1..ST4 multiple/lane and LD1R..LD4R arrangements and indices. Five unchanged source/object routes, four effective CPTA/CPTA0 modes at EL0, three post-index deltas per case. Full 128-bit vectors, completed base and every byte of 256-byte ordinary Normal WB buffers compare with independent original-register instructions. Model-only nonoverflow integer-ABI bridges; no native Apple CPA2, original SP/frame/call/unwind ABI, tagged/overflowing/foreign fault or reconstructed image qualification.",
